# GitHub Agents And Prompts

These files are task-specific personas and templates shared with GitHub Copilot. Cursor uses the same source of truth.

## Agents (`.github/agents/`)

| File | Use when |
|------|----------|
| `agentforce-reviewer.agent.md` | Reviewing Salesforce Agentforce metadata |
| `nest-ai-architect.agent.md` | Designing or reviewing NestJS AI API architecture |
| `rag-quality-reviewer.agent.md` | Reviewing RAG retrieval and grounding |
| `security-reviewer.agent.md` | Security, auth, secrets, and PII review |
| `telemetry-reviewer.agent.md` | AI telemetry and observability review |
| `release-checker.agent.md` | Release readiness and validation gates |
| `code-review-orchestrator.agent.md` | Coordinating multi-area code reviews |
| `case-triage-slice-implementer.agent.md` | Implementing the case triage walking skeleton |
| `new-org-tenant-onboarding.agent.md` | Onboarding a new org or tenant |

## Prompts (`.github/prompts/`)

| File | Use when |
|------|----------|
| `create-agentforce-action.prompt.md` | Creating a new Agentforce action |
| `add-llm-provider.prompt.md` | Adding a new LLM provider |
| `create-rag-endpoint.prompt.md` | Creating a RAG endpoint |
| `review-agentforce-metadata.prompt.md` | Reviewing Agentforce metadata changes |
| `review-ai-change.prompt.md` | Reviewing AI API changes |
| `implement-case-triage-slice.prompt.md` | Implementing the case triage slice |
| `onboard-new-org-tenant.prompt.md` | Onboarding a new org or tenant |
| `generate-production-runbook.prompt.md` | Generating a production runbook |

Do not duplicate content from these files into Cursor rules.
